%% title: Roll out a host change, one node at a time
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CI as CI
    participant C as binary cache
    participant S as Delivery
    participant O as ghcr
    participant A as host applier
    participant K as API server
    CI->>C: push signed closures
    CI->>CI: VM test per node class
    CI->>S: host rollout (GitHub OIDC token)
    S->>O: publish host/#lt#59;node#gt#59;:#lt#59;n#gt#59; with the order payload
    A->>O: poll, take the highest, verify it
    A->>C: fetch and verify the closure
    A->>A: reboot needed? stage with boot, wait for the window
    A->>A: wait for the predecessor's Node annotation, or a recorded skip
    A->>K: take the Lease, evict pods
    A->>A: switch or reboot, health check
    A->>K: uncordon, release the Lease
